    "bodies": ["Maple as fuel sounded gimmicky, but these pace me through 20-milers with zero gut issues.", "I used to dread gels. These go down like a sip of syrup and settle instantly. No cramping.", "Clean label, real maple, works. I keep two in my vest for anything over an hour.", "Switched from the branded gels and my long runs feel smoother. Energy stays flat, not spiky.", "Salted maple is my hot-weather pick. The sodium helps and the flavor isn't fake.", "Cold brew pouch at mile 14 is a cheat code. Caffeine kicks in cleanly, no jitters.", "Did a 50k on these and finished feeling like I could keep going. Three on the course, no issues.", "Trail mix box is perfect for a weekend of hiking. Variety keeps my mouth happy.", "Pouch is soft, cap reseals, no sticky mess on my shorts. Small thing, big difference.", "I feed these to my teenagers before soccer games. They actually like the taste.", "Original is nostalgic. Tastes like pancakes without feeling heavy.", "Pricey, yes, but one of these replaces two of the sugar bombs for me.", "Been using these for crit races. Fast absorbing, no bonk.", "Cold brew is my new ride-start ritual. Smooth energy for the first two hours.", "Honest ingredients, honest energy. Not pretending to be candy.", "Took these on a thru-hike section. Lightweight, no mess, kids on the trail wanted some.", "The subscription keeps me stocked without thinking. Easy to pause before I travel."]
